[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3788940317","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115212#issuecomment-3788940317","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115212","id":3788940317,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7h1qQd","user":{"login":"squk","id":3443591,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDM1OTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3443591?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk","html_url":"https://github.com/squk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T08:07:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T08:07:10Z","body":"> Stashed nodes are not saved in PackedScene\r\n\r\n\"Stashing\" typically mean to store something, which makes this seem bit counterintuitive(even more so with the stash icon from the proposal). Granted, the definition of stashing also includes some mention of a secret place, so I can see why this was chosen. Some alternative verbs that I think are more intuitive are \"detach\", \"suspend\". Or  maybe \"shelved\", \"parked\", \"benched\" or \"volatile\" ? Personally, I like \"transient\" or \"volatile\". \r\n\r\nIdk just a suggestion :) ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3788940317/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confu